        "title": "The diagram below shows how fabric is manufactured from bamboo.   Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The diagram below shows how fabric is manufactured from bamboo. </strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">make</strong><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> comparisons where relevant</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QQGwdUnBQovypJxJD0UlxWEXgFc\"><em><strong>The diagram below shows how fabric is manufactured from bamboo. </strong><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and </strong><strong>make</strong><strong> comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Fabric Manufacturing from Bamboo</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Fabric Manufacturing from Bamboo y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất vải tre.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Fabric Manufacturing from Bamboo với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất vải tre.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GeeUdQb36o3wNZx6LtIlPDxJgmg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GvLpdo409oaM1NxYMPGlWLmCgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất vải tre bao gồm ch&iacute;n giai đoạn ri&ecirc;ng biệt</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GrCkdtEVzoDEcoxkVHplSwW8gwe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bắt đầu với việc trồng c&acirc;y tre v&agrave;o m&ugrave;a xu&acirc;n v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c bằng việc tạo ra vải dệt</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RRprdk95coUCgKxp7UvlHji2g0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh n&agrave;y kết hợp cả kỹ thuật n&ocirc;ng nghiệp v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng nghiệp, đ&ograve;i hỏi v&agrave;i th&aacute;ng để ho&agrave;n th&agrave;nh từ việc trồng trọt đến sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EWBqdukMvoRpsPx54C2lSFDEgTd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 5 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxTBdg7xmotB4IxysDolXxrwgGb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DdLpdtAmTovuL8xRJNylymLZgOh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>c&acirc;y tre </strong><em>(bamboo plants)</em><strong> </strong>được trồng v&agrave;o m&ugrave;a xu&acirc;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CrW8dH5o6oGmbFx8PN2lbHsZgm7\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau một thời gian sinh trưởng, tre trưởng th&agrave;nh được thu hoạch v&agrave;o m&ugrave;a thu, khi c&acirc;y đ&atilde; <strong>đạt k&iacute;ch thước tối đa </strong><em>(reach their optimal size)</em><strong>.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmwsdeykXoJmO4xLI2WlzHmUgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tre được thu hoạch sau đ&oacute; <strong>được cắt th&agrave;nh dải</strong> <em>(be cut into strips)</em> bằng <strong>thiết bị cắt chuy&ecirc;n dụng</strong> <em>(specialized cutting equipment)</em>, trước khi được nghiền để <strong>tạo ra bột nước</strong> <em>(create a liquid pulp).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gbp5diheSon1F0xRn4Sl2cSSgTK\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bột n&agrave;y <strong>trải qua qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh lọc </strong><em>(undergo a filtering process)</em> để t&aacute;ch c&aacute;c sợi d&agrave;i ra khỏi <strong>phần lỏng</strong> <em>(the liquid component).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LYuddTXqMoXoYCxioYhlhxBzg49\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 4 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKUkdJOHsoqhTBxBMhwlIuUDgSe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsCSdct4CotQSfxDxnDlkouwgcf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c giai đoạn tiếp theo tập trung v&agrave;o <strong>việc tinh chế v&agrave; xử l&yacute; c&aacute;c sợi đ&atilde; chiết xuất </strong><em>(refining and processing the extracted fibers)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0CldY9ICoNRalxsDNoltTx3gHe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nước v&agrave; amin oxit được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o để <strong>l&agrave;m mềm </strong><em>(soften)</em> c&aacute;c sợi, l&agrave;m cho ch&uacute;ng ph&ugrave; hợp cho <strong>sản xuất dệt may</strong><em> (textile production)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Df1ydkOOvoxVcrxZIcfl48pagrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c sợi đ&atilde; l&agrave;m mềm sau đ&oacute; <strong>được k&eacute;o sợi để tạo ra chỉ </strong><em>(be spun to create yarn)</em>, đ&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; l&agrave; nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc; cho sản xuất vải.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BwiWdV21folOgRxVUGelJPHcgTe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cuối c&ugrave;ng, chỉ <strong>được dệt lại với nhau</strong> <em>(be woven together)</em><em><strong> </strong></em>để tạo th&agrave;nh vải tre ho&agrave;n thiện, <strong>ho&agrave;n tất chu tr&igrave;nh sản xuất</strong> <em>(completing the manufacturing cycle).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1684,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W4rodMuyWoARemxZcfElPubDgYb\">The diagram illustrates the manufacturing process of bamboo fabric.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1685,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T38zdQ4o2omi9sxDjudlmGqGgUh\">Overall, the production of bamboo fabric involves nine distinct stages, beginning with the cultivation of bamboo plants in spring and culminating in the creation of woven fabric. In addition, the process combines both agricultural and industrial techniques, requiring several months to complete from plantation to final product.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1686,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OekJdZD0LoQDTPx6iOtlhpJCgt8\">The manufacturing process commences with planting bamboo plants during the spring season. After a growing period, the mature bamboo is harvested in autumn, when the plants have reached their optimal size. The harvested bamboo is then cut into strips using specialized cutting equipment, before being crushed to create a liquid pulp. This pulp undergoes a filtering process to separate the long fibres from the liquid component.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1687,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMPzdxVdMoYwaGxiomFlDJTXgEg\">The subsequent stages focus on refining and processing the extracted fibres. Water and amine oxide are added to soften the fibres, making them suitable for textile production. The softened fibres are then spun to create yarn, which serves as the raw material for fabric production. Finally, the yarn is woven together to form the finished bamboo fabric, completing the manufacturing cycle.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
